      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1954, the city purchased four acres along Murphy Creek, creating what is now Hillside Park.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mapleview%2C_Minnesota",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Residents first received natural gas in 1962, modernizing the town’s utilities and improving daily life.",
